OL,3,GNEWSAPrison 'more robust' in dealing
OL,4,Awith drug problem
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey prison where drugs were once
OL,7,Fdescribed as easier to get hold of than
OL,8,Fsugar is making progress in its war
OL,9,Fagainst illicit substances, according
OL,10,Fto a new report.
OL,12,FFollowing its June inspection, the HM
OL,13,FInspectorate of Prisons said HMP High
OL,14,FDown in Banstead had become "more
OL,15,Frobust" in its response to the problem,
OL,16,Fwith positive random drug tests
OL,17,Fdropping from 31% during its 2023 audit
OL,18,Fto 19%.
OL,20,FBut, despite that being "better than at
OL,21,Fmany jails", the report added the
OL,22,Fnumber was still too high.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
